@startuml RuntimeViewProductive
title Runtime-view Productive

actor "User" as user
note as UserNote
  The user calls https://<domain>:443 or http://<domain>:8080
end note
user .. UserNote

[OpenIMS (:443 and :8080)] as OpenIMS
note as OpenIMSNote
    Started by container-engine (for example docker).
    The domain can be set using the commandline-parameter "--InitialDomain <domain>".
    Backend and frontend are running in the container.
end note
OpenIMS .. OpenIMSNote

[Database (:5432 or :3306)] as OpenIMSDatabase
note as OpenIMSDatabaseNote
    Database-container
    Port can be changed of course but must be updated in the connection-string in the OpenIMS-configuration.
end note 
OpenIMSDatabase .. OpenIMSDatabaseNote

user --> OpenIMS
OpenIMS --> OpenIMSDatabase
@enduml
